@ProyectMVP.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5290
@DeviceId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@ApiKey = DEMO_KEY

### Health
GET {{ProyectMVP.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health

### Login policía (demo)
# @name login
POST {{ProyectMVP.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "policia",
  "password": "demo"
}

### Buscar avistamientos (requiere JWT)
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
GET {{ProyectMVP.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/plates/ABC123/sightings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reportes de hurto de la placa (requiere JWT, filtrado por país del usuario)
GET {{ProyectMVP.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/plates/ABC123/stolen-reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Hotspots / tendencias (mapa de calor, últimos 30 días por defecto)
GET {{ProyectMVP.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/analytics/hotspots?category=all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Hotspots — solo posibles hurtos
GET {{ProyectMVP.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/analytics/hotspots?category=potential_match
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Login admin importador
# @name adminLogin
POST {{ProyectMVP.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "demo"
}

### Importar hurtos (JSON) — requiere rol AdminImporter
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
POST {{ProyectMVP.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/stolen-reports/import
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "format": "json",
  "countryIsoCode": "CO",
  "sourceSystem": "POLICIA_CO_BATCH",
  "records": [
    {
      "plate": "DEF456",
      "theftDateUtc": "2026-05-10T14:30:00Z",
      "ownerDocument": "CC998877665",
      "cityName": "Medellin",
      "status": "ACTIVE",
      "brand": "Mazda",
      "vehicleClass": "SUV",
      "vehicleLine": "CX-5",
      "color": "Negro",
      "modelYear": 2022
    }
  ]
}

### Importar hurtos (CSV — simula otro formato de país)
POST {{ProyectMVP.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/stolen-reports/import
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "format": "csv",
  "countryIsoCode": "CO",
  "sourceSystem": "POLICIA_CO_CSV_LEGACY",
  "payload": "plate,theft_date,city,owner_document,brand,class,line,color,model_year,status\nGHI789,2026-05-12T09:00:00Z,Bogota,CC112233445,Chevrolet,Pickup,D-Max,Gris,2021,ACTIVE"
}

### Ingesta dispositivo (batch) — sin JWT, usa X-Api-Key
POST {{ProyectMVP.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/devices/{{DeviceId}}/sightings/batch
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "plate": "XYZ789",
      "seenAtUtc": "2026-05-19T12:00:00Z",
      "latitude": 6.250000,
      "longitude": -75.570000,
      "confidence": 92.5,
      "evidenceUrl": "https://storage.demo/evidence/xyz789_1.jpg",
      "evidenceType": "IMAGE"
    }
  ]
}
